## 全量战斗状态静态目录。只描述真实结算，不依赖当前玩家、房间、Run 或解锁存档。
## 同名状态在玩家与敌人两侧规则不同，统一用 target=both 并在 rules 中分侧说明。

static func _e(id: String, kind: String, target: String, group: String, title: String,
		summary: String, rules: Array, sources: Array, runtime_ids: Array) -> Dictionary:
	return {
		"id": id, "kind": kind, "target": target, "group": group,
		"name": title, "summary": summary, "rules": rules,
		"sources": sources, "runtime_ids": runtime_ids,
	}


